          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Aitopel Apsolom, “Nya akïlan pich cho le 12,000 arïpan Daudi oghonete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oporyeghonan nyinte otini kikwaghach akïma mu. Otyeghan nyinte kïryagh pikachi cho mi tïkwïl, aparan nyu pöytoghin onkït. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayokwan nyu pikö löwïr kïpka wölo iminyi kïle mïrar nyo ngwïnöy wölo mi pontenyi. Ngwangwa ketïgh chi akonga atökïsïch chinö walaka kalya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïcham Apsolom ngölyontononi nko poyi Israel löwïr.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Apsolom, “Okurunö Usyay chi pö Arkit, atökelïma lö mwoghöy ne.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kitï Usyay wölo mi Apsolom, kïlenchï Apsolom nyinte, “Anyï ngölyon nyo kamwa Aitopel, kïrïpöyï? Atomölenyona, imwowecha lö kighöy ne.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Usyay Apsolom, “Melö karam ngölyontonï kamwa Aitopel ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkïtönyi lö papongu nko pikachi kï nyökon nyoman akïköromöch le koghyö nyo kakïsara warechi. Akunkït papongu poryot, mempurönye nko pikachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi nyinte nyete le ye kïwïngo kegh köpön anta wop anka. Akwotini kakïpar pich ompö porye nyini tagh, lentöy chi nyo kalïm, ‘Chang pich cho kakïpar ompö pipö Apsolom!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnyökoritu pich cho le nyökon, kïrökegh kö köromöch le ngötuny kïmeghyot mutïnö, ompöwölo nkït Israel lö, papongu kï chi nyo körom nko pikachi tïkwïl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwoghan nyo le ani lö mïchini kurönyi pipö Israel löwïr kïngata söröm ntökwit sörömu anka, cho tenö chongïntöngwa ngayama sörömu nanam aiwenyi tïkwïl poryot nko chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kepokyicha nyinte le talam ompö wölini kïnyorchini, amöngötunye nyinte nko pich löwïr cho mi tïkwïl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato rïpchï kanasyan, kwipu pipö Israel löwïr pörköy kepechicha kechït kïröytö tömkö, möminye kagh ompö akong nyo ngötu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Apsolom nko pipö Israel löwïr, “Karam ngölyonto Usyay chi pö Arkit kïtïl nyo pö Aitopel.” Kökikïkïl ECHOTYON kunyar ngölyonto Aitopel nyay karam, atökwipchï ghöyityö Apsolom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kakïrirchï Daudi kïchïwït",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïmwochï Usyay Sadok nko Apyatar chay le tïsï, ngölyon nyo kimwochï nyinte Apsolom nko kintöghoghi Israel nko nyo kimwa Aitopel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö Usyay, “Ayontena ye nyu chi lawel kïwö kïmwochï Daudi lö, ‘Merï aghonete wölay kyoghyegho ompö surkwen, wölo ioghyö antakwagh lawel, atömökïpar nyinte nko pikachi löwïr cho mi tïkwïl.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimi Yonatan nko Aimaas kïköngisïyi ompö Enrokel, kimi mötworin nyo le työ nyo kiwetöy kïnomnyö kïmwochini chane ngal atökïpa kïmwochï Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsïwa karöchïnin chane asistanka akïwö kïmwochï Apsolom. Kïryagh pïchay ntökwit kö pö chi nyo mi Paurim nyo kitïng kö pö pögh nyo kimi katanyi, kïlït chane ori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkartegha koko chichay köröwon köyay pö pögh akukorkorchï pagh parak atömösöwï chi lö mi ne ori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kitï mötwori Apsolom köyay mi kokonay, kïtep lö, “Mi onö Aimaas nko Yonatan?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï kokonay chane, “Kipa kwoghyö lalwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpa kïrïpata chane amökïnyorïcha, kïmïlisyö Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany otini kikïpa pïchay, kïpkana pïchay köyay pö pögh. Kïpa chane wölo mi Daudi akïmwochï tötut pö Aitopel ompö nyinte kïlenchï, “Ngeta aioghyö lalwa lawel.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnget Daudi nko pikachi löwïr akwoghyö Yordan, atotenö kiwasan kimökïminye chi ompö akonga nyo kingötï kïtomö kwoghyö Yordan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kisïwa Aitopel lö melö kikïrïp ngalechi, kïrat sïkïryenyi akïwö kutang kanasyantenyi. Akuyomis monechi atolapay kuket kegh. Ketïpchï pïrïmpeto paponyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kökikwit Daudi Maanaim, ato oghyot Apsolom Yordan nko pipö Israel löwïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kökikutö Apsolom Amasa kughyongtö pipö lïk kïtöpö atay kömi Yoap. Amasa kï wero chi nyo kikïkuro Itra nyo pö pipö Ismael nyo kip Apikail chepö Naas chepto ompö Seruya, yoto Yoap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtek Apsolom nko pipö Israel emenikwa koro Kiliad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kit Daudi Maanaim, kïtarok nyinte Syopi wero Naas nyo pö kanasyanta Rapa nyo pö pipö Amon nko Makir wero Amiel nyo ngwïno Lo Depar nko Parsilay nyo pö Kiliad nyo ngwïno Rokelim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwipchï pöröyon nko otupöy nko tören nko nkanun nko matay nko pïsya nko pagh cho kakïkel nko kunten nko denkun ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nko kumat nko mwaghpa chö nko panya kechir, akutö Daudi nko pikachi tökwam, ompöwölo kilö, “Kikwoghochö pïchï akikwam kömöy nko maral ompö surkwen.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
